		</div></div></div></div><a id="about" class="in-page-link" href="#"></a><section class="  light-wrapper normal-padding vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid light-wrapper normal-padding vc_custom_1487666101450"><div class="container "><div class="row "><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-md-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h3 style="text-align: center;">About</h3>
<p style="font-size: 20px; text-align: center;"><strong>SOTHEMA</strong> is a 100% Moroccan pharmaceutical company, specializing in the manufacturing and sale of medicines since 1976. <strong>SOTHEMA</strong> represents 35 client laboratories ranking among the global R&amp;D leaders.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="btn-lg btn" href="https://sothema.com/about/" target="_blank">READ MORE</a></p>
		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="image-bg overlay parallax  light-wrapper normal-padding vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid light-wrapper normal-padding vc_custom_1458832400828">
			<div class="background-image-holder">
