			</div>
		<div class="container "><div class="row "><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-md-2"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-md-8"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h3 class="mb8" style="text-align: center;">SOTHEMA is now moving into the sector of biotechnologies.</h3>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="btn-lg btn" href="https://sothema.com/research-and-development/" target="_blank">READ MORE</a></p>
		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-md-2"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="  light-wrapper pt64 pb64 vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid light-wrapper pt64 pb64"><div class="container "><div class="row "><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-md-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h3 style="text-align: center;">Manufacturing facility</h3>
<p style="font-size: 20px; text-align: center;">Covering an impressive surface area of 60,000 square meters, the manufacturing facility site of <strong>SOTHEMA</strong> is one of the leading pharmaceutical plants in Morocco. Meeting the generally accepted industrial engineering standards in the pharmaceutical field, the production facility of <strong>SOTHEMA</strong> has been cleverly designed to allow for later extensions.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="btn-lg btn" href="https://sothema.com/manufacturing-facilities/" target="_blank">READ MORE</a></p>
		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="  bg-primary normal-padding vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid bg-primary normal-padding"><div class="container "><div class="row "><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container col-md-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
